  "prefLabel": "Puc 802.17 Underground facility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 802.17 “Underground facility” means “underground facility” as defined in RSA 374:48, VII, namely, “any property which is buried, placed below ground, or submerged on a public way, private property, right-of-way, easement, public street, or other public place and is being used or will be used for the conveyance of cable television, electricity, gas, sewerage, steam, telecommunications or water.”\n\nSource. #9318, eff 11-8-08 (from Puc 802.16); ss by #12102, eff 2-8-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc800.html"
